        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions DLG01030, Delong Stainless Steel Door Pull with Hourglass Mounts</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 1 inch diameter stainless steel door pull from First Impressions can be used in many applications such as residential front doors, commercial office entry doors, storefront doors, or as an appliance handle. This is a customer sized 30 inch pull with 22 inch mounting centers. The Stainless Steel Delong Pull is made from long lasting stainless steel with brass hourglass-shaped mounts. It can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Delong Stainless Steel Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Matte Black</b></li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 22\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Bracket Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1.66\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
